格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH web plugin: show every session's theme in the left sidebar on load","id":"gh:1336042099","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-theme","slug":"Xliecc/dsh-session-theme","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH web plugin: show every session's theme in the left sidebar on load"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-theme"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH web plugin: the left sidebar shows **every session's theme right on page load** — no need to cli"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ck into a conversation first."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## The problem"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"In the DSH sidebar, sessions you haven't opened yet show **no theme** — just the workspace folder na"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"me (or a placeholder id). The theme only appears after you click into the session."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Root cause:** for \"cold\" sessions (never opened in this process), `session.list` only reads the pr"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ojection cache's zero-I/O rows (`cachedSnapshot`). If a session's `title` projection was never check"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"pointed, its list row has no `title`, so the sidebar falls back to the folder name. Only opening the"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" session (which triggers the full cold-read ladder) recovers the title."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"At **startup** the plugin runs the projection cache's cold-read ladder (`coldSnapshot`) for every pe"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"rsisted session: it refolds the `title` projection from the stored log and **durably writes it back "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"to the cache**. After that, every row returned by `session.list` carries a `title` projection → the "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"sidebar natively shows each session's real theme, no click required."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Only \"cold\" sessions are processed (not opened in this process); sessions that are already loaded "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"already carry live projections in their list rows.\n- Fail-soft per session: a corrupted log never af"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"fects other sessions and never blocks startup.\n- Idempotent write-back: the next boot hits the cache"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" fast path instantly."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"See ARCHITECTURE.md for the full design and data flow."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Verify it works"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Install the plugin (any method below), then **hard-refresh the browser** (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+R).\n2. O"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"pen the DSH Web sidebar — every session row should show its conversation theme, not a folder name.\n3"},{"id":"p13s3","text":". To confirm the hit, run: `dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-session-theme` and watch the server log"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" for the line: `dsh-session-theme: projection cache warmed (N sessions)`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Link install, zero external dependencies (host side uses only standard services):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Or clone from GitHub:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Or install from npm:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"After installing, **hard-refresh the browser** (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+R) so the client re-pulls `session.li"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"r installing, **hard-refresh the browser** (Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+R) so the client re-pulls `session.list`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Files"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host side: warms the projection cache at startup (all behavior)\n- `lib/client.js`"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" — browser-side stub (no-op, keeps the registered manifest consistent)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
